          'When Semuta itself was proposed as the now-prevented allied gift, its donor may spend it to claim that counter’s used cost. Prevention first retains Semuta and restores the original parent; the same committed response then spends Semuta and takes the cost, without a second prevention or transfer to the ally. Passing keeps Semuta. Other commitments remain enforced.',
          'Printed-role Karama stopping Atreides auction inspection, Ixian auction preparation or Advanced Technology also offers its exact cost before prevention. Claim or Continue resumes the original lot or ordinary draw once, without new inspection, extra Ix choice or exchange. Technology stays used and its original unseen lot remains; the native Atreides peek follows. If outgoing Semuta was selected for that now-prevented exchange, only that reservation releases so Semuta can claim the counter’s cost. Other commitments and independent knowledge remain.',
